# Shared Inbox

- Packing dual-writes `DTF Des-P*.xlsx` into `Shared Inbox/DTF Des/{date}/{shift}/`.
- Queue Missing Logo auto-watcher processes those files (no approval) and moves them to `Processed/` or `Failed/`.
- Do not delete live inbox files while packing or the watcher may be writing.
- Shipping does not auto-read this folder yet.
